# Object Recognition Starter
# Rate-coded visual classifier with a compact hidden layer and 10-class output.

Define a network named object_recognition_starter with timestep 0.0021.
# Network with 1 input, 2 LIF populations, 2 linear transforms, 1 output.
# flow: input -> retina -> features -> classes -> output

# Layers:
Define an input port named input with shape (784,).
Define a LIF neuron named retina with time constant 0.02, resistance 1.0, leak voltage 0.0, and firing threshold 0.8.
Define a linear transformation named w_retina_features with weight matrix shape (128, 784) annotated with metadata weight_init equal to "xavier" annotated with metadata seed equal to 101.
Define a LIF neuron named features with time constant 0.02, resistance 1.0, leak voltage 0.0, and firing threshold 0.6.
Define a linear transformation named w_features_classes with weight matrix shape (10, 128) annotated with metadata weight_init equal to "xavier" annotated with metadata seed equal to 102.
Define a LIF neuron named classes with time constant 0.03, resistance 1.0, leak voltage 0.0, and firing threshold 0.7.
Define an output port named output with shape (10,).

# Connections:
input connects to retina.
retina connects to w_retina_features.
w_retina_features connects to features.
features connects to w_features_classes.
w_features_classes connects to classes.
classes connects to output.
